  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: marcus
  title: The Man in the Tower
  summary: 'Marcus works at Sterling''s tower, feels guilty about it, and finds the dumping paperwork. Part 7 needs the flag saw_tower_dumping (the StoryTrigger in the tower''s back room). Fork: take the proof to city hall, or accept a promotion to ''change it from inside''.'
  pathAName: Blow the whistle
  pathBName: Take the promotion
  parts:
  - title: A guilt thing
    number: 1
    heartsNeeded: 1
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Hey! The farmer. You know, I bought all my vegetables from the Kims this week. All of them. Even the ones I don't know how to cook.
    - Lena says I'm trying to buy forgiveness one turnip at a time. She's not wrong.
