      friendship: 0
  - title: The window office
    number: 8
    heartsNeeded: 8
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Victor called me up to the fortieth floor today. Victor Sterling himself.
    - He offered me a promotion. A window office. Double the pay. 'A man like you could change how things are done here, Marcus.'
    - Or I take the memory stick to Lucia at city hall tomorrow, and I never work in this city again.
    - Lena says it's my decision. I'm asking you, because I can't trust myself to answer.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 1
      optionA: Take it to city hall
      replyA:
      - Right. Tomorrow, nine o'clock, city hall. Lucia said she'll be at her desk with a sandwich and a book.
      - I'm terrified. I feel better than I have in a year.
      flagsA:
      - marcus_whistleblower
      - tower_file_manifests
      optionB: Take the promotion
      replyB:
      - From the inside. Yes. That's the smart way. You can't change anything from outside, can you?
      - I'll keep the memory stick. Just in case. Just... in case.
      flagsB:
      - marcus_promoted
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Out of work
    number: 9
    heartsNeeded: 9
    path: 1
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - They walked me out of the building with a cardboard box. Like in the films. There was a plant in it. It died on the way home.
    - 'But the street... Frank left a toolbox on the porch with a note: ''Fix something.'' Rosa sent bread. Gus told me I''d done the right thing and then told me my porch was crooked.'
    - City hall is looking at the shipping sheets. Lucia says it'll take months. I've got nothing but time.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
