      friendship: 0
  - title: The fortieth floor
    number: 9
    heartsNeeded: 9
    path: 2
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The window office has a view of the river. I didn't think about that when I said yes.
    - I can see the pipe from my desk. At night the water goes a different colour.
    - I'm changing things from the inside. I've changed the coffee machine. It's a start. It's a start, isn't it?
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
